 ('94f0d91e-dec0-5225-bc09-a809e2d1db5e', '2025-2026', 69617, 61533, 13665, 8906, 8009, 20323, 18291, 40388, 35233, 3.52, 97.8, '{"4.0": 9.0, "3.75-3.99": 27.5, "3.50-3.74": 22.3, "3.25-3.49": 17.6, "3.00-3.24": 13.4, "2.50-2.99": 9.1, "2.0-2.49": 1.0, "1.0-1.99": 0.1}'::jsonb, 'CDS covers the whole ASU Campus Immersion (Tempe, Downtown Phoenix, Polytechnic, West Valley); Tempe-only figures are not published separately. Undergrad enrollment and intl count are the B1/B2 ''Total Undergraduates'' columns (64,662; nonresident 5,300). No early decision or early action; no waitlist policy. ASU did not report SAT/ACT percentiles or percent submitting scores in C9.', 'e24f6f1c-75bc-5776-b504-2fdf87417a85');
