 ('a4d5a870-eb91-5f1d-acd3-9f1963d4ade7', '2023-2024', 10567, 32467, 19477, 1000, 1000, 30939, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; The scholarships page says all applicants are considered automatically (President''s, Provost''s, Dean''s, Achievement scholarships; no separate application) but does not say whether international students are eligible, so no international aid policy is recorded. International admits must document funds for the first year before an I-20 is issued.', '2f0a51a0-0f60-58a9-a7b3-4730d3e85799');
