 ('ff2bedac-6e20-5610-a123-b0eb89e63d92', '2025-2026', 72180, 1328, 19290, 1250, 2000, 'merit_only', false, 20, 39634, false, true, 'CDS G1/G5 (2024-2025 edition, which lists 2025-2026 costs). Transportation varies and is not included in other_usd. H6 reports 2024-2025 aid to nonresidents: institutional non-need-based aid only; 20 awarded (need- or non-need-based), average $39,634. The interview row of C7 was left blank in the CDS and is omitted from factors.; BC is unable to provide need-based financial aid to students who are not US citizens or permanent residents; international students should expect to pay full cost. Merit aid for international students is not described on the international page; the 2024-2025 CDS (H6) reports non-need-based institutional aid to 20 nonresident undergraduates. Gabelli Presidential Scholars merit program exists (eligibility for international applicants not confirmed).', 'f038a939-c9b1-5a72-9809-9bd59990a473');
