 ('a2d4d562-20f9-5be0-b31a-3ebfe8cc2628', '2025-2026', 69870, 1502, 19970, 1000, 1455, 'merit_only', false, 231, 56639, false, true, false, 'CDS G1/G5 (2025-2026). other_usd = G5 other expenses ($1,455); transportation ($630 for residents) is separate and not included. H6: BU offers nonresident undergraduates institutional non-need-based aid only (need-based not available); the 231 recipients / $56,639 average are all nonresident degree-seeking undergraduates awarded need-based or non-need-based aid.; BU Financial Assistance does not offer need-based University scholarship or grant aid to international students (except through select partner organizations). International first-year applicants are considered for merit scholarships; apply for admission by December 1 for scholarship consideration. CDS H6 for 2025-2026 also lists non-need-based aid only for nonresidents.', 'f2a8dd63-2c30-50b8-94f6-3dd648a25675');
