 ('04cf3b47-2569-5e90-88bc-892d892aec23', '2023-2024', 71740, 19560, 840, 1660, 88820, 'need_blind_full_need', true, true, false, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Need-blind for international students and meets the full calculated need of every admitted student, with no loans in aid packages. Beginning with the Class of 2031, international applicants (excluding Canadians) submit aid materials (CSS Profile, code 3089) only after being admitted. International transfer students are not eligible for institutional aid.', '2b38f11f-2a33-51b2-91fc-a05edd566522');
