 ('843737d4-c374-5f10-9244-1dcc341b0983', '2026-27', array['common_app']::text[], true, 2, true, 80, 'Four Brown essays required on the 2026-27 Common App (more for PLME and the Brown-RISD dual degree). Two teacher recommendations from major academic subjects; at least one math/science teacher for B.S. or PLME. Automatic fee waivers for FRPL-eligible students. Interview and CSS Profile requirements not confirmed on pages checked.', '515df2ce-d751-53ef-9ac3-76eca0077135');
