 ('3ed3721b-9031-5fe0-89f6-7beea7e2f31f', '2025-2026', 11285, 428, 248, 263, 211, 1, 78, 22, 'Restrictive early action (no ED): CDS C22 lists EA closing 11/1, notification 12/15; no ED plan (C21 = No). Applicants = 7,772 men + 3,513 women; admits = 224 + 204. C1 residency table and C11/C12 (GPA) are blank in the CDS; C10: 97.3% of the 14.9% who reported rank were in the top tenth. I2 student-to-faculty ratio is 7 to 1 overall (3 to 1 for undergraduates). 37 of the 248 enrolled first-years are nonresidents (B2).', '1817c517-de31-5c09-b4d4-fb698fb46e4e');
