 ('8a277593-1fe5-517c-a6dc-89613a207f44', '2025-2026', 33750, 29715, 6497, 2731, 2274, 19700, 17820, 11319, 9621, 8.97, 24.53, 3.67, 99.72, '{"4.0": 24.8, "3.75-3.99": 20.83, "3.50-3.74": 18.45, "3.25-3.49": 14.86, "3.00-3.24": 11.4, "2.50-2.99": 9.12, "2.0-2.49": 0.44, "1.0-1.99": 0.11}'::jsonb, 'CDS is for the UC Main Campus. Counts are CDS C1 (fall 2025 first-time, first-year); GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11. No waiting list. Only 583 enrollees submitted SAT and 1,594 submitted ACT, so the percentiles describe small groups. CDS C7 marks talent/ability ''very important'' (probably for CCM/DAAP programs). Undergrad and international counts are B1 ''Total Undergraduates'' (nonresident 1,625).', '02860089-7adb-563a-ae1d-0702b239a7b8');
