 ('d9748a4e-22e6-53f3-a783-3eec36acde9d'::uuid, 'College of Engineering & Applied Science', 'engineering', 'Students are admitted directly into a major. UC lists Engineering among colleges that often fill early; apply by the Nov 1 Early Action deadline.'),
 ('3e058378-4d46-5a75-9469-49886e37b02e'::uuid, 'Lindner College of Business', 'business', 'Direct admission to a major. Listed among colleges that often close shortly after Nov 1.'),
 ('38ea8c9d-5f8f-51c4-b82b-2721db839b46'::uuid, 'College of Nursing (BSN)', 'nursing', 'Priority application deadline Nov 1. For English proficiency Nursing accepts only SAT EBRW 480 or ACT English 19.')) v;

