 ('869dac5f-e3ea-568c-9884-83ac4b395d73', '2025-2026', 6939, 655, 335, 978, 216, 2344, 115, 2599, 267, 1996, 273, 711, 469, 61, 34, 14, 'CDS C1 totals are for the fall 2025 entering class (in-state = California; international enrollees 57). C21: ED I closes 11/1 (notified 12/15), ED II closes 1/10 (notified 2/15 per CDS dates as printed); no early action. High school GPA is not reported (C11/C12 blank), so no GPA figures. Test-optional: SAT/ACT ''not required but considered if submitted'' (C8A).', '358f44fd-f28c-56c2-81a7-7164f5e9ffd5');
