 ('5a8f2d66-5e64-5432-a0fb-a69a713858ba', '2025-2026', 64805, 27498, 5084, 1457, 560, 10697, 5661, 52651, 21277, 13297, 4506, 1801, 38, 19, 100.0, '{"4.0": 85.95, "3.75-3.99": 9.46, "3.50-3.74": 2.69, "3.25-3.49": 0.98, "3.00-3.24": 0.55, "2.50-2.99": 0.31, "2.0-2.49": 0.06}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 enrollees 5,084 include 2,669 in-state, 2,357 out-of-state, 58 international. Clemson reports no early decision; early action closes Oct 15 with notification by Dec 15 (C22). The C12 average GPA value was blank in the published file, so gpa_avg is omitted; the C11 GPA bands are very top-heavy (86% at 4.0), which suggests a weighted GPA. Standardized tests are not required but considered if submitted (C8A).', 'bdd53681-43b4-55b2-9513-cf73efdaf702');
