 ('91cd7fd8-46d3-565e-ad53-48ad2dbb4885', '2023-2024', 17513, 47142, 19838, 1200, 3042, 37189, 'merit_only', false, false, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Non-US citizens are not eligible for federal aid and CU Boulder offers no direct loans. All international first-year applications with complete documents by Jan. 15 (and English proficiency on file) are automatically reviewed for the Chancellor''s Achievement Scholarship and the Presidential Scholarship; no SAT/ACT needed. Full scholarships are rare (athletics; College of Music offers tuition awards).', '4d149465-725b-526c-9ca4-ade1f1a71929');
