 ('2d3f8334-1622-5d6c-b5d8-bb94e5907301', '2026-2027', 69207, 2318, 20920, 1005, 2648, 'need_blind_full_need', true, 483, 87562, true, false, 'CDS G1 (first-year): tuition $69,207, required fees $2,318, food and housing $20,920; G5 books $1,005, transportation $608 + other $2,040 (other_usd = 608 + 2,040). The CDS G1 checkbox says 2026-27 costs are ''not available'' yet values are filled in, so the year label follows the CDS prompt. H6: need-based institutional aid available to nonresidents; 483 awarded, average $87,562, total $42,292,307.; Need-blind for international applicants since the Class of 2026; meets 100% of demonstrated need regardless of citizenship. CSS Profile (school code 3351) required for international applicants; the ISFAA is accepted if the Profile fee is a hardship. No merit scholarships are mentioned on the pages read.', '72c6b134-1a3a-5dee-88be-47f788699b92');
