 ('896861bc-d8aa-5153-8b28-3fbed6e8adae', '2023-2024', 67897, 25200, 1590, 3644, 85904, 'need_aware_limited', true, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Review of non-immigrant international applicants is need aware. Partial merit scholarships up to $25,000 (no extra application, for those not applying for need-based aid). Need-based aid goes to a limited number of first-year fall international students who indicate need on the Common App, can demonstrate a family contribution of at least $50,000/yr, and submit the CSS Profile by the application deadline. Awards stay the same for four years.', '93bc8658-b65c-5e19-93cb-e94cc079b823');
