 ('biology_life_sci', 'C', 'Marine biology and tropical ecology benefit from the Hawaii location and an ocean and earth science school on campus; placed C. Editorial judgment, not a ranking.'),
 ('pre_med', 'D', 'Editorial judgment (v1, reviewed 2026-10-20)'),
