 ('4fbefaaf-e530-51da-b425-1ee363f88308', '2025-2026', 15591, 13642, 3775, 1401, 463, 7088, 6643, 7102, 6536, 7, 80, 3.86, 86.54, '{"4.0": 13, "3.75-3.99": 39, "3.50-3.74": 21, "3.25-3.49": 13, "3.00-3.24": 7, "2.50-2.99": 6, "2.0-2.49": 1, "1.0-1.99": 0}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 residency split (in-state 7,088 / out-of-state 7,102 / international 1,401 applicants). International admit rate computed 463/1,401 = 33.0%, with 43 enrolled, much lower than the overall 87.5%, so international applicants should not assume near-certain admission. Undergrad enrollment and intl count are the B2 ''Total Undergraduates'' column (16,555; nonresident 253). No early decision or early action; no waitlist; no application closing date; priority date December 1. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column (reported by 86.5% of students).', '40783cf9-72ae-5b9d-944e-aa527309fd0f');
