 ('f6040c2d-ba4d-59dc-aba6-4510dba616b5', '2025-2026', 25526, 16015, 4026, 3113, 2566, 16510, 10028, 5903, 3421, 16, 43, 3.64, 98.1, '{"4.0": 25.3, "3.75-3.99": 18.78, "3.50-3.74": 17.64, "3.25-3.49": 15.15, "3.00-3.24": 13.0, "2.50-2.99": 9.07, "2.0-2.49": 0.86, "1.0-1.99": 0.2}'::jsonb, 'CDS is for the Kent campus only (Kent State publishes a separate CDS for each campus). Counts are CDS C1 (fall 2025); GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11. No early decision, early action or waiting list. The CDS admit rate (62.7%) is lower than the rate implied by the fall 2024 figures on third-party sites; only the CDS figures are used here. Undergrad and international counts are B1 ''Total Undergraduates'' (nonresident 932).', 'db54cf06-8b82-5c2f-a74d-c14c513267c9');
