 ('e8f004d9-e85d-584b-b179-48f5a2d4c46b', '2023-2024', 65430, 25030, 1326, 6332, 90646, 'need_aware_limited', true, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; UM is need-aware for first-year and transfer international applicants. International students who want to be considered for financial aid must submit the CSS Profile (school code 5815) by the financial aid deadline. The page does not say whether full demonstrated need is met for international students. All applicants are considered for merit scholarships (EA and ED I applicants also for Premier Scholarships).', '10776461-4365-5c5e-befe-b7f6ee29b682');
