 ('a88c321f-2c01-5ce0-9d0c-59dea94f0e2b', '2025-2026', 18648, 16372, 4734, 1006, 530, 9229, 8169, 8413, 7673, 7, 81, 3.54, 91, '{"4.0": 8, "3.75-3.99": 24, "3.50-3.74": 21, "3.25-3.49": 30, "3.00-3.24": 12, "2.50-2.99": 4, "2.0-2.49": 1}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 residency split (in-state 9,229 / out-of-state 8,413 / international 1,006 applicants; international admit rate computed 530/1,006 = 52.7%, 64 enrolled), so international applicants are admitted less often than the overall 87.8%. Undergrad enrollment and intl count are the B2 ''Total Undergraduates'' column (19,787; nonresident 457). No early decision or early action; no waitlist. Application closing date May 1 and priority date Nov. 1 (C14). GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column; the CDS reports whole percentages.', '57d8b112-5b09-593d-8409-47972899a670');
