 ('367be2ae-a805-58bb-9ea2-631bb3f88e3e', '2025-2026', 39685, 35561, 4540, 1069, 983, 17003, 15317, 21613, 19261, 3, 27, 3.7, 91, '{"4.0": 32, "3.75-3.99": 19, "3.50-3.74": 15, "3.25-3.49": 12, "3.00-3.24": 10, "2.50-2.99": 10, "2.0-2.49": 2}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1/C9/C11/C12 (fall 2025). Only 154 enrolled students (3%) submitted SAT, so SAT percentiles describe a small self-selected group. Of 983 admitted international first-years only 12 enrolled (C1 residency table). The 1.0-1.99 GPA band is under 1% and omitted. No waitlist; no early decision or early action. Student-faculty ratio is I-2 (fall 2025, 19 to 1).', '7aa63b2e-4bca-5c0b-b68a-b781f14a97c6');
