 ('367be2ae-a805-58bb-9ea2-631bb3f88e3e', '2026-2027', 12096, 29568, 29568, 1343, 14432, 900, 4500, 'merit_only', false, 129, 9320, true, false, 'CDS G1/G5 (2026-27): nonresident tuition equals out-of-state ($29,568); room and board = housing $7,790 + food $6,642; other_usd = other expenses $2,000 + transportation $2,500. G4: 20% of full-time undergraduates pay more because of program fees. H6: only institutional non-need-based aid is available to nonresidents; 129 received it (avg $9,320).; International Excellence Award (IEA): up to $11,000 per year as an out-of-state tuition waiver for first-time, full-time F-1 undergraduates on the Flagstaff campus with a 3.0+ GPA at admission; no separate application, awarded first come, first served; renewable with full-time enrollment and a 3.0 GPA. Not available to sponsored students or dual-degree or PIE students. CDS H6: nonresidents get institutional non-need-based aid only. Foreign citizens are not eligible for FAFSA.', '7aa63b2e-4bca-5c0b-b68a-b781f14a97c6');
