 ('ca042073-2af7-5158-ba3a-bc286568be24', '2026-27', array['common_app','coalition','questbridge']::text[], 'Notre Dame Writing Supplement: one required essay (max 150 words) on non-negotiable factors when choosing a college, plus two short-answer questions of 50-100 words each.', 1, true, 85, true, 'One core-academic teacher letter; a second letter is required and Notre Dame highly recommends the school counselor write it (another community member may if none is available). Interview policy not stated on the pages read. Aid forms: international students seeking need-based aid must complete the CSS Profile; the first-year pages list FAFSA/CSS Profile/IDOC priority dates.', '5547d1a6-fd50-56f0-9370-d776b2101723');
