 ('2e85a67d-1b3b-514c-97a7-552372c12e68', '2026-27', 'required', 'ACT or SAT scores are required for Columbus-campus first-year applicants (including international). Superscoring of section scores; ACT Science not required; essay not required. Scores must come directly from the testing agency.', '257fd348-6e31-5638-b498-f6529aed4889');
