 ('a49d80ae-e1a1-54b6-bceb-1e3bd69434dc', '2025-2026', 8040, 28605, 28605, 5280, 15720, 1790, 'merit_only', 10, 16000, false, true, 'CDS G1 (first-year, 2025-26); 2026-27 rates not found. H6: both institutional need-based and non-need-based aid are marked available to nonresidents; 10 nonresidents were awarded aid, average $16,000 (the CDS lists a $300,000 total, which does not equal 10 x $16,000).; ODU''s International Student Scholarship is a renewable (up to four years) undergraduate merit award of $5,000 to $16,000 per year for qualified international applicants. The FAQ recommends submitting SAT/ACT for this scholarship. The admissions pages do not mention need-based aid for international students; the CDS marks institutional need-based and non-need-based aid as available to nonresidents (10 awarded, avg $16,000). Whether a separate scholarship form is needed is not stated.', '6edf701e-88f3-5354-a9e6-cccfecf36c5f');
