 ('2ea3c1e4-e561-5ad8-b07e-c39055855d32', '2023-2024', 22736, 43432, 15728, 576, 2872, 38719, 'merit_only', false, false, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Financial aid is not available to international students. International first-year fall applicants with a complete application by Feb 1 are automatically reviewed for scholarships of up to $10,000 per year (generally eight full-time terms). Proof of financial support required upon admission.', '3ea753a4-989e-5974-895a-f53fdc6bd72f');
