 ('7d143b07-c6d4-5ab5-aa68-8a12e1b0fea0', '2023-2024', 67857, 19550, 1490, 4265, 87824, 'need_aware_limited', true, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Rice considers international applicants on a need-aware basis and offers need-based aid to a limited number of international first-years; request aid on the International Student Financial Statement at application (aid cannot be requested later). Uses the CSS Profile for international aid applicants. Merit scholarships are separate, based only on merit, about 20% of admitted students receive them, no separate application. The page does not say whether full need is met for international students (the first-year page says domestic applicants are need-blind with 100% of need met without loans).', '17a9914f-bb9a-58bc-97eb-eb15b53e3eff');
