 ('2e083b83-f0ff-575f-8101-e7547bf6ac25', '2023-2024', 68429, 19756, 1799, 2077, 87852, 'merit_only', false, false, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; "International undergraduate students are considered for merit-based scholarships based on their application for admission," awarded by the Office of Admissions at the time of admission. The financial aid page describes no need-based aid for international students; FAFSA and CSS Profile are only for U.S. citizens and eligible noncitizens. F-1 applicants must show proof of liquid funds for one full academic year.', 'e3b6806f-87d3-52cf-b7f0-2a59f98c2709');
