 ('ce406595-5873-549c-91cf-2c52d1405bd1', '2026-27', 'blind', 'UC does not consider SAT or ACT scores in admission decisions or scholarships. Scores may be self-reported only after submitting the application, and are used for eligibility alternatives or placement after enrollment.', '59eef79d-f346-569e-839f-3f315982f498');
