 ('f698d33c-bb66-5414-82a8-543cf4846078', '2026-27', array['uc_app']::text[], 'Personal Insight Questions (UC application)', 0, false, 80, true, 'Fee is $95 for international applicants; fee waivers are limited to US citizens, permanent residents and AB540-eligible applicants. Fall entry only for first-years.', 'b2305c87-c23a-5294-b370-6cae338ac64a');
