 ('sat', '4860', 'UCSC publishes ''school code 004860'' (College Board, used for AP/SAT reporting; shown as 4860 without leading zeros). UC does not consider SAT/ACT in admissions.'),
 ('toefl', null, 'No undergraduate TOEFL code found on admissions pages. UC: self-report scores in the application; send official scores only to the campus where you enroll.'),
 ('ielts', null, 'UCSC page: ''An institutional code is NOT required.'' Have the test center send scores electronically to UC Santa Cruz, Office of Admissions.')) v;
