 ('cf3d6113-a1d5-5598-a2b8-d012c7ba0c06', '2023-2024', 6381, 30886, 12615, 825, 4360, 23197, 'none', false, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Students on F-1/F-2/J-1/J-2 or G-series visas are not eligible for federal aid administered by UF; the page says they may be eligible for private or college-awarded scholarships. No international need-aid program is described.', '3110f3bb-cd9b-557a-8119-7b7bb3451f65');
