 ('3e512b67-e6f8-5a28-ac52-6d439854761e', '2025-2026', 53117, 31813, 5315, 6714, 3634, 22603, 13062, 23800, 15117, 11100, 7261, 2349, 24.9, 4.05, 99.3, '{"4.0": 59.9, "3.75-3.99": 21.1, "3.50-3.74": 12.4, "3.25-3.49": 5.3, "3.00-3.24": 0.7, "2.50-2.99": 0.4, "2.0-2.49": 0.1, "1.0-1.99": 0.0}'::jsonb, 'CDS C11 all-enrolled column. Only 24.9% of enrolled first-years submitted SAT, so SAT/ACT ranges describe a small self-selected group. ACT submit rate omitted: the CDS prints 0.3% beside a count of 160 (about 3.0%), which conflict. GPA average is a weighted figure (above 4.0). Early action closes 11/5. Fall 2025 entering class.', 'db37bf70-39d5-531c-9103-f8d4211349f7');
