 ('1532a872-1f5b-5818-af57-e857d8bb7a85', '2025-2026', 41488, 3487, 13298, 4294, 62567, 'merit_only', false, true, false, 'International page, ''Estimated Expenses for the 2025 Academic Year'' (taken as 2025-26): tuition and fees $41,488; room and board $13,298; books and personal/miscellaneous $4,294; required health insurance $3,487; total $62,567. In-state tuition is not given on this page.; First-year students are automatically considered for UMass Boston merit scholarships from their admissions application; international students with a 3.3 GPA or higher are considered for merit scholarships of up to $10,000 annually. Not available to students entering through partnership programs. The international page does not mention need-based aid, so that is left unconfirmed.', '8e92df2d-dc80-5f9b-a28d-99eacf9be17f');
