 ('9ab5fc2c-d342-5565-8a8e-16005bf859a3', '2026-27', array['common_app','own']::text[], 'One essay (650 words max) from UMD''s list of prompts or a topic of your choice; plus activities list or resume.', 1, true, 80, true, 'Apply via Common App or UMD''s own ApplyWeb (same review). Two recommendations required: one school counselor and one teacher. Mid-year reports/first-quarter grades are not required unless requested at decision notification.', '23cd67b1-c9d0-5171-8885-e47b69d3dfdf');
