 ('9ab5fc2c-d342-5565-8a8e-16005bf859a3', '2026-2027', 10490, 40253, 40253, 1800, 16747, 1250, 1200, 'none', false, false, 'CDS G1/G5 (first-year, flat undergraduate rate; 23.8% of undergraduates pay more because business/engineering/CS charge differential tuition). The CDS also ticks ''final 2026-2027 costs not yet available'', so treat these as estimates. other_usd is miscellaneous personal expenses; transportation estimate ($1,514) not included. UMD charges $125 per semester to students needing an I-20/DS-2019. CDS H6: no institutional scholarship or grant aid for nonresident undergraduates.; Institutional merit scholarships are open to US citizens and eligible non-citizens only; CDS H6 says no institutional scholarship or grant aid is available for nonresident undergraduates.', '7242b549-0db9-5e90-83de-b6c433bda837');
