 ('TOEFL_IBT_2026', 4.5, '{"writing": 4.5}'::jsonb, 'New scale; scores effective starting the Spring 2027 application period. Overall 4.0 falls in the ''AZ hold'' band (admitted but extra English course may be required). Carlson requires both overall and writing minimums.'),
