 ('c23bd466-96a4-5d5a-b54d-13ebf4ac231c', '2023-2024', 71236, 19876, 1412, 3088, 92288, 'need_aware_full_need', true, true, false, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Need-aware for international applicants (non-citizens/non-permanent residents of the US, Canada and Mexico); admitted aid recipients get need-based aid covering 100% of demonstrated need. Aid must be requested at the time of application and cannot be added later. No merit aid (awards are need-based).', '9343227b-deb4-55a5-9d39-420d05e4012a');
