 ('27ac595e-8dde-5e8c-8670-a6f952caa83b', '2025-2026', 83488, 9345, 3759, 16615, 2275, 32499, 3692, 34374, 3378, 33, 12, 3.85, '{"4.0": 28.2, "3.75-3.99": 52.0, "3.50-3.74": 14.3, "3.25-3.49": 3.5, "3.00-3.24": 1.1, "2.50-2.99": 0.7, "2.0-2.49": 0.2}'::jsonb, 'Fall 2025 entering class (CDS 2025-2026 C1, C9, C11, C12). The CDS reports no early decision plan and no wait-list policy for 2025; USC''s admissions site now lists ED and EA for the 2026-27 cycle. GPA distribution is the all-enrolled-students column. Test-optional: SAT/ACT percentiles describe the 33% (SAT) and 12% (ACT) who submitted scores. ACT English percentiles are blank in the CDS.', 'eb156418-da7c-51e6-94ea-3a6193b627c4');
