 ('PTE', 58, 'PTE Academic.'),
 ('CAMBRIDGE', 180, 'C1 Advanced, grade C or higher (scale 180). Also accepted: iTEP Academic 3.8; TOEFL ITP paper test 550 only for the UTSA Academic English Program or International Pathway. Students below the minimums may look at UTSA''s Academic English Program or International Pathway (global.utsa.edu; entry scores not checked here); Shorelight Education also offers support programs.')) v;
