 ('2aa888c5-5b52-5fe3-b321-72ebfd5e66ab', '2023-2024', 71226, 23048, 1100, 2000, 94142, true, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; International applicants requesting need-based aid are considered on a need-aware basis (need-blind applies only to US citizens and eligible non-citizens). The page''s 100%-of-need pledge is stated for US citizens and eligible non-citizens, not for international students. For fall 2026 Vanderbilt offered aid to 89 international students from 54 countries; awards ranged $16,815-$99,998 per year. International first-years may apply for all merit scholarships (small number of top applicants). Need-based aid requires the CSS Profile or ISFAA.', '51cf1bb5-2d0f-55ab-878a-5e46e236b6d8');
