 ('11898a70-3021-526f-9eb2-79cf6b3bbdc5', '2026-27', 'optional', 'SAT/ACT scores are optional and "only required if you indicate in your application that you want them considered"; self-reported scores accepted, multiple sittings are superscored. Students who wanted scores considered must send official scores in the summer before arrival.', 'eb118d49-4b1e-5514-ac54-535d4003c442');
