 ('11898a70-3021-526f-9eb2-79cf6b3bbdc5', '2023-2024', 70332, 19054, 1718, 3430, 91202, 'merit_only', false, false, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; "Wake Forest University does not offer any need-based financial aid to foreign national students." International students are eligible for most merit scholarships, including full-cost awards (Carswell, Gordon, Reynolds, Stamps); the regular application doubles as the scholarship application. Applicants not given a merit award must show sufficient support on the Confidential Financial Information for International Applicants form before admission is considered. (WFU says it meets 100% of demonstrated need for domestic students.)', 'e5d6d86d-1f15-5048-aca8-adb21db8d890');
