 ('1ef7bed2-2e21-5878-87fb-f47c4cd20bec', '2025-2026', 17263, 14430, 3071, 664, 406, 15236, 12973, 1363, 1051, 35.88, 2.64, 3.42, 95.47, '{"4.0": 14.67, "3.75-3.99": 19.51, "3.50-3.74": 15.96, "3.25-3.49": 14.02, "3.00-3.24": 14.12, "2.50-2.99": 20.26, "2.0-2.49": 1.43, "1.0-1.99": 0.03}'::jsonb, 'Counts are CDS C1 (fall 2025; 917 applicants of unknown gender are included in the totals). GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11. No waiting list, early decision or early action. Only 81 enrollees submitted ACT scores (1,102 submitted SAT), so ACT percentiles describe a small group. Undergrad and international counts are B1 ''Total Undergraduates'' (nonresident 394).', '8d4a906e-2f31-5830-9512-d16688316018');
