 ('TOEFL_IBT', 79, 'Exams through January 2026 (Home Edition accepted). English Language Pathways Program range 61-78.'),
 ('TOEFL_IBT_2026', 4.0, 'Exams after January 2026 (Home Edition accepted); the page does not name the 1-6 scale. Pathways range 3.0-3.5.'),
 ('IELTS', 6.5, 'Academic IELTS. Pathways 5.5-6.0 with no section below 5.5. No sub-score requirement for regular admission. TOEFL Essentials 9.0 also accepted.'),
 ('DUOLINGO', 105, 'Pathways range 90-104.'),
 ('PTE', 53, 'PTE Academic and PTE Express. Pathways range 44-52.')) v;
