 ('98e9cab9-81a4-5cde-a912-c263d89f7f42', '2025-2026', 20927, 17853, 2303, 808, 226, 14374, 12555, 5745, 5072, 50.1, 3.6, 3.55, 98.5, '{"4.0": 18.8, "3.75-3.99": 21.7, "3.50-3.74": 17.0, "3.25-3.49": 14.8, "3.00-3.24": 13.1, "2.50-2.99": 13.6, "2.0-2.49": 0.9, "1.0-1.99": 0.1}'::jsonb, 'Counts are CDS C1 (fall 2025). International first-year admit rate in the CDS is 28% (226 of 808), much lower than the overall 85.3%. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11. No waiting list, early decision or early action. Only 84 enrollees submitted ACT scores, so ACT percentiles describe a small group. Undergrad and international counts are B1 ''Total Undergraduates'' (nonresident 1,284).', 'a196ff1d-8711-5e44-8d16-733a24c7fa27');
