 ('1fc27a15-e777-5e46-b48e-fbdfee783e71', '2025-2026', 8736, 6311, 1738, 573, 466, 4784, 3361, 3379, 2484, 4.2, 71.0, 3.41, 100.0, '{"4.0": 7.0, "3.75-3.99": 25.0, "3.50-3.74": 22.0, "3.25-3.49": 13.0, "3.00-3.24": 11.0, "2.50-2.99": 16.0, "2.0-2.49": 5.0, "1.0-1.99": 1.0}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025). International first-year applicants: 466 of 573 admitted (81%). No waitlist; no early decision or early action. Undergrad enrollment 14,906 is B1/B2 total undergraduates including non-degree-seeking; intl_undergrads 2,147 is the B2 nonresident total (only 438 of them degree-seeking undergraduates, 55 first-time first-year). Only 73 enrolled freshmen (4.2%) submitted SAT, so SAT percentiles (composite 1050/1160/1260) rest on a small group; ACT composite is 17/21/24. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column.', '18a4ae51-47dd-59b5-8aea-033d1480a588');
