 ('TOEFL_IBT', 100, 'Competitive applicants typically score 100-120 (taken before January 2026). Typical range, not a minimum.'),
 ('TOEFL_IBT_2026', 5, 'Competitive applicants typically score 5-6 on the new scale. Typical range, not a minimum.'),
 ('IELTS', 7.5, 'Competitive applicants typically score 7.5-9. Typical range, not a minimum.'),
 ('DUOLINGO', 135, 'Competitive applicants typically score 135-160. Typical range, not a minimum.')) v;
