 ('0484af38-0265-5b9f-aea4-0095a7ef5c5e', '2023-2024', 63246, 18900, 1200, 1200, 80569, 'need_aware_limited', true, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Need-aware at the application stage; limited need-based assistance for international first-year and transfer students (CSS Profile due by the admissions deadline). WPI says competitive international applicants typically contribute at least $25,000 per year. Up to two WPI International Leadership Awards per year (up to full tuition and fees, possible $12,000 housing allowance); all admitted fall-entry international students are considered automatically.', '9a745069-8be0-594a-8775-dad5ad2ac5b2');
